{
  "_doc": "#1369 THE Cloud Notes theme: Obsidian's default theme, as data. base/accent/extended are Obsidian's documented CSS variables (docs.obsidian.md Reference > CSS variables > Foundations); semantic is the default theme's mapping (app.css 1.x) of Obsidian's names onto them; affine maps every AFFiNE variable the app paints with onto an Obsidian name, so the editor, canvas, sidebars and dialogs all wear Obsidian's colours. scripts/gen-obsidian-theme.py writes the web sheet (component/src/theme/obsidian.gen.css) and the native tokens (apps/android .../theme/ObsidianTokens.kt) from this file; test/test-obsidian-theme.sh fails on drift and proves each mapping red by mutation. A value is a hex, a ref (\"base-30\", \"accent\", \"red\") or \"<ref>@<alpha>\".",
